            <description><![CDATA[<h3>1.1.5</h3>
<ul>
<li>The "Playing" row only appears for sound you can actually hear — muted autoplay videos no longer count.</li>
<li>Picture in picture only pops out a video you're watching with sound. Muted videos, previews and short clips stay put.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
