            <sparkle:version>16</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.1.4</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<h3>1.1.4 — Colors and tiles</h3>
<ul>
<li>The top bar takes on each site's color, with text that stays readable. Turn it off in Settings › Appearance.</li>
<li>Pinned tabs are now big icon tiles, three across, like Dia.</li>
<li>Dragging tabs is smoother: the list parts to make room where the tab will land. Drag a tab to the top to pin it.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
