            <description><![CDATA[<h3>1.1.3 — Drag your tabs</h3>
<ul>
<li>Drag tabs and folders to reorder them; a line shows where they'll land.</li>
<li>Drag a tab above the divider to pin it, onto a folder to file it, or past the top of the list to add it to Favorites.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
